---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PlaceCard from '../components/PlaceCard.astro';
import {places} from '../lib/places';
---
<Layout title="Discover"><section class="intro"><div><p class="meta">A change of scene, in Dubai</p><h1>Work from<br/>somewhere new.</h1><p class="lead">Cafés, co-working spaces, restaurants and hotel lounges for your next workday.</p><form action="/explore/" class="search"><label for="discover-q">Find a place or neighbourhood</label><div><input id="discover-q" name="q" type="search" placeholder="Try JVC, JLT or a place name" maxlength="120"/><button class="primary">Explore places <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div></form><p class="meta popular">Start with <a href="/explore/?neighbourhood=JVC">JVC</a> · <a href="/explore/?neighbourhood=JLT">JLT</a> · <a href="/explore/?neighbourhood=Dubai+Marina">Dubai Marina</a></p></div><figure class="hero-photo"><img src="/images/scene-1.jpg" alt="Illustrative café interior, not a listed Dubai venue" width="800" height="700" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>Room for a different routine. Illustrative stock photography.</figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="mode-section"><div class="section-title"><h2>What’s the plan?</h2><p>Find a setting for the way you work.</p></div><div class="mode-grid">{[['Focus','A little space to concentrate.'],['Casual','Emails over a coffee.'],['Meetings','A setting for a conversation.'],['Together','Bring the team along.']].map(([m,t])=><a href={`/explore/?mode=${m}`}><strong>{m}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></strong><span>{t}</span></a>)}</div><p class="meta">Work modes are editorial suggestions. Check each place’s amenity evidence and policies.</p></section>
<section><div class="section-title"><div><h2>A few places to begin</h2><p>Fictional listings to explore the experience.</p></div><a href="/explore/">Explore all {places.length} places ↗</a></div><div class="cards">{places.slice(0,4).map(p=><PlaceCard place={p}/>)}</div></section>
<section class="trust"><h2>Know before you go.</h2><p>Wi-Fi, power and laptop policies need their own evidence. See what was checked, when, and what still needs confirming.</p><a href="/about/">How evidence works ↗</a></section></Layout>
